          "label": "Recto, witness clauses",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>[ &hellip; ] \u02bfAbdulkar\u012bm [testified] to the acknowledgement of Mu\u1e25ammad ibn Isma\u02bf\u012bl ibn al-Q\u0101sim ibn Ihr\u0101h\u012bm ibn I[sma\u02bf\u012bl &hellip; ]</li>\n<li>[ &hellip; ] Mu\u1e25ammad ibn \u02bfAbdall\u0101h al-\u1e24\u0101zim\u012b [testified] to the acknowledgement by Mu\u1e25ammad ibn Isma\u02bf\u012bl ibn al..[Q\u0101sim &hellip; ]</li>\n<li>[ &hellip; l]l\u0101h [testified] to the acknowledgement by the three of them of what is in this document [ &hellip; ]</li>\n<li>[ &hellip; ] \u02bfAbdall\u0101h ibn Sa\u02bf\u012bd [testified] to the acknowledgement by Mu\u1e25ammad ibn I[sma\u02bf\u012bl &hellip; ]</li>\n<li>[ &hellip; ] al-Makhz\u016bm\u012b [testified] to the acknowledgement by the three of them of what is in this [document &hellip; ]</li>\n<li>[ &hellip; ] \u02bfAl\u012b ibn R\u0101zi\u1e25 ibn Ra\u1e25ab al-... [ &hellip; testified &hellip; ]</li></ol>\n",
